# SolarEPC-Pro Professional Edition Walkthrough

I have upgraded the platform to the **Professional EPC** level, aligning with the 8-module curriculum.

## New Features (Phase 4)
- **Module 3: Cable Sizing**:
    - Auto-suggests cable size (4/6/10/16/25 mm²) based on Ampacity and Voltage Drop.
    - Checks IEC 60364-5-52 ampacity limits.
- **Module 5: Thermal & PR**:
    - Calculates Performance Ratio (PR).
    - Displays NOCT-based Cell Temperature.
    - Detailed loss breakdown (Soiling, Mismatch, Wiring).
- **Module 6 & 7: Advanced Financials**:
    - Light-Induced Degradation (LID) for Year 1.
    - Detailed Annual Cashflow Table (Revenue, OPEX, Debt).

## Previous Features (Phase 3)
- **Module 2: Inverter Sizing**: DC/AC Ratio, Safety Checks.
- **Module 4: Geometry**: Row Spacing & GCR.
- **Module 8: Reporting**: PDF Feasibility Report.

